MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

lavInspect(fit,"cor.lv <http://cor.lv/>") produces the model-implied correlation matrix of the latent variables. Predict gives factor scores so cor(lavPredict(fit)) gives the correlation between factor scores that are proxies of the latent variables.

